{"id":"npc:%E5%A5%A5%E5%A6%AE%E6%8B%89","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"整合运动成员。","spoiler":true,"source":""}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_2431_1-1$2.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_2431_1-1$2.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_2431_1-1$2.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_01_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":302,"line":303,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"不行，看不懂对面是什么来历。"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_01_end","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":28,"line":29,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"雷德！你还好吗？"},{"commandIndex":49,"line":50,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"……不不不，雷德！"},{"commandIndex":50,"line":51,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"这不是我的源石技艺！"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_06_end","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":813,"line":814,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"我准备好了！"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_07_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":175,"line":176,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"收到，但时间太紧张，我们没办法准备得太完善。"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_st03","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":955,"line":956,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"……塔拉斯，来得正好，帮我压一下箱子。"},{"commandIndex":998,"line":999,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"塔拉斯，米拉娜提醒过，别做多余的事——"},{"commandIndex":1018,"line":1019,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"我只是，想不出什么理由……"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_08_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":691,"line":692,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"……早不记得了。"},{"commandIndex":700,"line":701,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"我不知道。我只知道，远没有他们在远北屠杀的同胞多。"},{"commandIndex":704,"line":705,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"……那你哭什么？"}]},{"story":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_09_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":135,"line":136,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"塔露拉，米拉娜那边有新的消息。"},{"commandIndex":144,"line":145,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"是……城内守军已经放弃驻守城墙，所以米拉娜和九率领精锐队伍，包括罗德岛的随行人员以及中央集团军残部，往城内进军了。"},{"commandIndex":149,"line":150,"speaker":"奥妮拉","text":"是的，刚才侦察员回报城门处的情况，他们应该都进城了。"}]}]}